<title>USA: Dedham, Mass., won by BayBank Boston.</title>
<headline>Dedham, Mass., won by BayBank Boston.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank Boston said it won $2.470 million of Ded ham, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true intere st cost of 4.47 percent.</p>
